      "en": "I will wash my hands in innocence, so I will go about your altar, LORD,",
      "ko": "여호와여 내가 무죄하므로 손을 씻고 주의 단에 두루 다니며",
      "source_text_hash": "7e88e925b2b36e53e061e6db9e3740bd330764062cd30b59ac0704e4e7e07b4d",
      "translation_text_hash": "52b1f98b1134944ef88168783ba5613b35ec41ff4fa931f4bb71411673c232cb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
