      "en": "that I may make the voice of thanksgiving to be heard and tell of all your wondrous deeds.",
      "ko": "감사의 소리를 들리고 주의 기이한 모든 일을 이르리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "63acaa744e0fecf0e932138a1044f279c9d72202edf8b69712a098e764863f05",
      "translation_text_hash": "573d7e9387f5f278c907c8ad15b291b9b78d558888a5979f6df7258a636771e3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
