      "en": "Don’t gather my soul with sinners, nor my life with bloodthirsty men",
      "ko": "내 영혼을 죄인과 함께, 내 생명을 살인자와 함께 거두지 마소서",
      "source_text_hash": "15f2b30078888ce860e3881b57f8576c2e64124ef1a17f9db9628349aeb0f0f4",
      "translation_text_hash": "66f631552d66f609c7f9288c5aec8ffc912edc9839db2856029cbb8f19a88c3c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
