      ],
      "en": "But as for me, I will walk in my integrity. Redeem me, and be merciful to me.",
      "ko": "나는 나의 완전함에 행하오리니 나를 구속하시고 긍휼히 여기소서",
      "source_text_hash": "fff3a1221d96d6b925602784272b22adf083dca22dfb452ba44989295f706d48",
      "translation_text_hash": "4800899b2923255f955ad33e25e801d4964b4df49552ac663c66174df126ab9e",
